<% layout("/layouts/boilerPlate") %>

<div class="container mt-5 mb-5">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-md-10 col-lg-8">
            <h1 class="fw-bold mb-4">Content & Community Policy</h1>
            <p class="text-muted">Last Updated: July 2026</p>
            
            <hr class="mb-4">

            <section class="mb-5">
                <h4 class="fw-bold">1. Listing Guidelines</h4>
                <p>Hosts are required to provide accurate, truthful, and up-to-date information regarding their properties. Uploading misleading photographs, falsifying amenities, or attempting to bypass platform fees will result in immediate listing removal and account suspension.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="mb-5">
                <h4 class="fw-bold">2. Reviews and Interactions</h4>
                <p>AuraStays relies on honest and respectful community feedback. We strictly prohibit reviews or communications that contain:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Hate speech, discrimination, or harassment of any kind.</li>
                    <li>Spam, promotional material, or malicious links (e.g., phishing attempts).</li>
                    <li>Personally identifiable information (PII) of other users without consent.</li>
                    <li>Profanity, explicit content, or threats of violence.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="mb-5">
                <h4 class="fw-bold">3. Enforcement & Moderation</h4>
                <p>Our administrative team utilizes Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) to monitor the platform. AuraStays reserves the right to delete any listing, remove any review, and permanently ban any user who violates this Content Policy, at our sole discretion and without prior notice.</p>
            </section>

        </div>
    </div>
</div>